      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果不想事情变成那样——就只能“挣扎”。\r\n你明白我的意思吗，美妙？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b74534a8f2ecfa721d8558fd654a200e359f15d564515e6a434bb2c17eba1079",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
