      "uid": "zhcn:d0934af4dbeaabe48a5394c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然我和空中神宫不太熟，但我也知\r\n道她不是会用这样的恶作剧伤害他人的人。\r\n她应该有更加明确的目的——",
      "source_fingerprint": "c00e2eb2b0a36c9364715def0f06f8b4235af1b2cf255f696c2bea43ae3af34c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
